switchboardx
============

Original source code: MIT License (see LICENSE).

Bundled data files:

- data/catalog.starter.json: tool graph data derived from the public graph
  published at https://switchhboard.vercel.app, this project's own website
  (ownership confirmed by the author). The catalog describes third-party MCP
  servers; their tool names, descriptions and schemas remain the property of
  their respective authors.

- data/catalog.official.json: ingested from the live tools/list output of the
  official MCP reference servers (@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem,
  server-memory, server-sequential-thinking, server-everything),
  github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers. That project is under a licensing
  transition: code contributions are MIT License or Apache License 2.0
  depending on contribution; see the LICENSE at that repository. Both
  licenses permit redistribution with attribution, provided here.

Runtime dependency:

- neo4j-driver (Apache License 2.0), used to speak Bolt to HydraDB.

External server (not bundled, run separately):

- HydraDB (github.com/hydra-db/hydradb) is licensed AGPL-3.0. switchhboard-mcp
  connects to it as a client over Bolt or HTTPS; HydraDB is not distributed
  with this package.
